{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"api-index","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Index"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Markdown uses explicit subpath exports so applications can import only the parser, renderer, adapter, or extension they need."}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Package entry"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Contents"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"parser, inline parser, HTML renderer, and all shared types"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/parser"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"parseMarkdown"},{"type":"text","value":" only"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/html"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"HTML rendering functions"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/react"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React component and React rendering functions"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/octane"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane component and descriptor rendering functions"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/extensions/callouts"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"callout block parser"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/extensions/comment-components"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"comment-delimited component parser"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/extensions/docs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"composed docs extension preset"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/extensions/framework"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"framework component transform"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/extensions/headings"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"heading collection transform"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/extensions/streaming"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"incomplete-response placeholder transform"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/extensions/tabs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tab component transforms"}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"reference-pages","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reference pages"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./default-entry.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default Entry"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./parser.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parser"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./html.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"HTML"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./react.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./octane.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./types.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Types"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./extensions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extensions"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prefer narrow entry points in application code. The default entry is convenient when parser, HTML renderer, and public types are used together."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"api-index","text":"API Index","level":1},{"id":"reference-pages","text":"Reference pages","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# API Index\n\nTanStack Markdown uses explicit subpath exports so applications can import only the parser, renderer, adapter, or extension they need.\n\n| Package entry | Contents |\n| --- | --- |\n| `@tanstack/markdown` | parser, inline parser, HTML renderer, and all shared types |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/parser` | `parseMarkdown` only |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/html` | HTML rendering functions |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/react` | React component and React rendering functions |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/octane` | Octane component and descriptor rendering functions |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/callouts` | callout block parser |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/comment-components` | comment-delimited component parser |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/docs` | composed docs extension preset |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/framework` | framework component transform |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/headings` | heading collection transform |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/streaming` | incomplete-response placeholder transform |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/tabs` | tab component transforms |\n\n## Reference pages\n\n- [Default Entry](./default-entry.md)\n- [Parser](./parser.md)\n- [HTML](./html.md)\n- [React](./react.md)\n- [Octane](./octane.md)\n- [Types](./types.md)\n- [Extensions](./extensions.md)\n\nPrefer narrow entry points in application code. The default entry is convenient when parser, HTML renderer, and public types are used together.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: API Index\n---\n\n# API Index\n\nTanStack Markdown uses explicit subpath exports so applications can import only the parser, renderer, adapter, or extension they need.\n\n| Package entry | Contents |\n| --- | --- |\n| `@tanstack/markdown` | parser, inline parser, HTML renderer, and all shared types |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/parser` | `parseMarkdown` only |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/html` | HTML rendering functions |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/react` | React component and React rendering functions |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/octane` | Octane component and descriptor rendering functions |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/callouts` | callout block parser |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/comment-components` | comment-delimited component parser |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/docs` | composed docs extension preset |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/framework` | framework component transform |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/headings` | heading collection transform |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/streaming` | incomplete-response placeholder transform |\n| `@tanstack/markdown/extensions/tabs` | tab component transforms |\n\n## Reference pages\n\n- [Default Entry](./default-entry.md)\n- [Parser](./parser.md)\n- [HTML](./html.md)\n- [React](./react.md)\n- [Octane](./octane.md)\n- [Types](./types.md)\n- [Extensions](./extensions.md)\n\nPrefer narrow entry points in application code. The default entry is convenient when parser, HTML renderer, and public types are used together.\n"}
